  <main id="main" class="hp-slides">

    <!-- Slide 1: everything they need, on one screen. The hands come in from the edges, like the Let's Build videos. -->
    <section class="hp-slide hp-deck" data-anim aria-labelledby="s1">
      <img class="hp-hand hp-hand--robot" src="assets/art/hand-robot.webp?v=2" alt="" width="395" height="205" />
      <img class="hp-hand hp-hand--human" src="assets/art/hand-human.webp?v=2" alt="" width="330" height="314" />
      <div class="hp-wrap hp-deck__in">
        <p class="hp-deck__kicker">For offices, practices and service businesses, anywhere</p>
        <h1 class="hp-deck__title" id="s1">Your team types all day. <em>(Let AI do the typing)</em></h1>
        <div class="hp-deck__low">
          <span class="hp-deck__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8600;</span>
          <p class="hp-deck__tag"><b>Start with the <a class="inline-link" href="inbox-assistant" data-track="cta-hero-inbox">Inbox Assistant</a>: it drafts replies to your routine customer emails, from your own prices and policies. Ready in 3 business days.</b></p>
          <p class="hp-lead"><span data-zar="9500">R9,500</span> setup + <span data-zar="2950">R2,950</span> a month. A <span data-zar="1500">R1,500</span> deposit starts it, refunded in full if it doesn&rsquo;t save your team 5 hours a week.</p>
          <div class="hp-actions">
            <a class="hp-btn" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-hero-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
            <a class="hp-link" href="https://wa.me/27722375833?text=Hi%20Re-Charge%2C%20I%20saw%20your%20site%20and%20have%20a%20quick%20question." target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-hero-wa">Or ask on WhatsApp &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a class="hp-next" href="#problem" aria-label="Next"><span aria-hidden="true">&#8595;</span></a>
    </section>

    <!-- Slide 2: the problem -->
    <section class="hp-slide hp-problem" id="problem" aria-labelledby="s2">
      <div class="hp-wrap hp-problem__grid">
        <div>
          <p class="hp-num">01</p>
          <p class="hp-label">The problem</p>
          <h2 id="s2">Small tasks. Whole days.</h2>
          <p class="hp-problem__lead">None of it is hard; it just fills the day. It&rsquo;s different in every business: missed calls, invoices typed in twice, quotes that never get followed up, the same question for the tenth time today, and yes, the inbox.</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="hp-art hp-art--problem hp-pile" data-anim aria-label="The kind of work that piles up: missed calls, invoices to capture, quotes waiting, repeated questions and customer messages waiting since the morning.">
          <img src="assets/art/inbox-overload.webp?v=6" alt="" width="800" height="533" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="hp-chip hp-chip--1"><b>&#9742; 6 missed calls</b><small>each one a lost job</small></span>
          <span class="hp-chip hp-chip--2"><b>14 invoices to capture</b><small>typed into Xero by hand</small></span>
          <span class="hp-chip hp-chip--3"><b>Quote sent 9 days ago</b><small>no follow-up yet</small></span>
          <span class="hp-chip hp-chip--4"><b>&ldquo;What are your hours?&rdquo;</b><small>asked 11 times this week</small></span>
          <span class="hp-chip hp-chip--5"><b>&ldquo;Can you come today?&rdquo;</b><small>unread since 08:00</small></span>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <a class="hp-next" href="#how" aria-label="Next"><span aria-hidden="true">&#8595;</span></a>
    </section>

    <!-- Slide 3: how it works, for any kind of work -->
    <section id="how" class="hp-slide hp-flow" aria-labelledby="s3">
      <div class="hp-wrap">
        <p class="hp-num">02</p>
        <p class="hp-label">How it works</p>
        <h2 id="s3">Built around your work.</h2>
        <p class="hp-flow__lead">Not a new system to move to. It works next to the tools you already use.</p>
        <ol class="hp-steps">
          <li><span class="hp-step__ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="36" cy="12" r="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="24" cy="36" r="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M17 12h14M15 16l6 15M33 16l-6 15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><b>We map the work</b><span>What comes in, who handles it, how long it takes today</span></li>
          <li><span class="hp-step__ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><rect x="5" y="8" width="14" height="10" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="29" y="19" width="14" height="10" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="5" y="30" width="14" height="10" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M19 13h5v22h-5M24 24h5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><b>We build the workflow</b><span>Connected to the tools you already use</span></li>
          <li><span class="hp-step__ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M24 9c-4-4-12-2-12 5-5 1-6 8-2 11-3 5 1 11 7 10 1 4 5 5 7 3V9Zm0 0c4-4 12-2 12 5 5 1 6 8 2 11 3 5-1 11-7 10-1 4-5 5-7 3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M24 16h-5M24 24h-7M24 31h-4M24 20h6M24 28h7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><b>AI does the routine part</b><span>A person checks anything that matters</span></li>
          <li><span class="hp-step__ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="24" cy="26" r="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M24 26V16M20 5h8M24 5v5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><b>You see the time saved</b><span>Timed before and after, the same way</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <a class="hp-next" href="#see" aria-label="Next"><span aria-hidden="true">&#8595;</span></a>
    </section>

    <!-- Slide 4: the real thing -->
    <section id="see" class="hp-slide hp-show hp-show--light" aria-labelledby="s4">
      <div class="hp-wrap">
        <div class="hp-show__head">
