            <li class="is-time"><b>35 min</b><span>saved on these 10 emails</span></li>
            <li><b>5</b><span>replies drafted, ready to check</span></li>
            <li><b>2</b><span>urgent, flagged in red</span></li>
            <li class="is-time"><b>~3.5 h</b><span>a day, if you get 60 like these</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <ul class="hp-kinds" aria-label="Examples">
